## Proposed Changes

### DB Migration

#### [MODIFY] `users` table schema
- Add `microsoft_oid` (`text`, unique, nullable) — stores the Azure AD object ID for SSO-linked accounts.
- Make `password_hash` nullable — SSO users won't have a password.

```sql
ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN microsoft_oid TEXT UNIQUE;
ALTER TABLE users ALTER COLUMN password_hash DROP NOT NULL;
```

