## How the Full Flow Works

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant Backend
    participant Microsoft

    User->>Frontend: Click "Continue with Microsoft"
    Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/auth/microsoft
    Backend->>Frontend: 302 Redirect to login.microsoftonline.com
    User->>Microsoft: Sign in with company account
    Microsoft->>Backend: GET /api/auth/microsoft/callback?code=...
    Backend->>Microsoft: POST /token (exchange code for ID token)
    Microsoft->>Backend: ID token (oid, email, name, role claims)
    Backend->>Backend: Upsert user, issue JWT pair
    Backend->>Frontend: Redirect to /dashboard with token
    Frontend->>User: Logged in!
```

