## Role Assignment Logic

| Scenario | Result |
|---|---|
| First SSO login, no existing account | Create new user with role `analyst` |
| First SSO login, email already exists in DB (password user) | Link `microsoft_oid` to existing account, preserve existing role |
| Subsequent SSO login | Find by `microsoft_oid`, issue tokens with existing role |
| SSO user tries password login | Rejected — no `password_hash` on record |

