## Azure Setup Required (One-time, by you)

1. Go to **Azure Portal → App Registrations → New Registration**
2. Set redirect URI to `https://your-domain.com/api/auth/microsoft/callback`
3. Under **Certificates & Secrets**, create a client secret
4. Under **API Permissions**, add `openid`, `profile`, `email` (all Microsoft Graph, delegated)
5. Copy **Application (client) ID**, **Directory (tenant) ID**, and the **client secret** into `.env`

